  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"flex h-svh w-screen flex-col\"><div class=\"relative z-0 flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\"><div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\"><div class=\"@container/main relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col -translate-y-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)] pt-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)]\"><div class=\"@w-sm/main:[scrollbar-gutter:var(--stage-scroll-gutter)] touch:[scrollbar-width:none] group/scroll-root relative flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col [scrollbar-gutter:stable] not-print:overflow-x-clip not-print:overflow-y-auto group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:[overflow-anchor:none] scroll-pt-(--header-height) [--sticky-padding-top:var(--header-height)] [--sticky-padding-bottom:0px] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top:calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom:calc(var(--sticky-padding-bottom)+var(--screen-keyboard-height,0px)+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-height:calc(100lvh-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top)-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom))] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px]\"><div class=\"group/thread flex flex-col min-h-full\"><div class=\"composer-parent flex flex-1 flex-col focus-visible:outline-0\"><div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\"><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\">PRIV</a></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">is a Canadian women’s fashion brand focused on elevated everyday essentials designed for modern women balancing real life and personal style. Our collections feature timeless lounge, matching sets, dresses, outerwear, and effortless wardrobe staples created with comfort, femininity, and wearability in mind. PRIV pieces are intentionally versatile, designed to move from school drop-offs and errands to coffee dates, travel, and everyday life while still feeling polished and elevated.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• What makes us different:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">PRIV blends comfort with a refined, high end aesthetic that feels effortless rather than overstyled. We focus on:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Elevated everyday dressing</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Premium feeling fabrics and flattering fits</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Neutral, timeless palettes</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Wearable trends without fast-fashion energy</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Female founder led authenticity and real life styling</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our content and products are created to feel aspirational yet attainable — the kind of pieces women actually reach for repeatedly.</span></p><hr><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• How affiliates can earn:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>20% commission on all qualifying sales</strong></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">made through their custom affiliate link or discount code. We offer competitive commission rates because we value creators who genuinely love and share PRIV with their audience.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Additional opportunities may include:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Bonus incentives for top-performing affiliates</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Early access to launches and new collections</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">PR gifting opportunities</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Long-term ambassador and paid partnership potential</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We’re focused on building authentic, ongoing relationships with creators who align with the PRIV aesthetic and community.</span></p></div><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• How to promote us:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We encourage affiliates to promote PRIV through authentic, lifestyle-driven content such as:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Outfit styling videos</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">GRWM/Reels/TikToks</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Try-ons and fit reviews</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Daily outfit inspiration</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Travel, mom-life, wellness, and lifestyle content</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Instagram Stories with links and discount codes</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The best-performing content feels natural, wearable, and relatable while still elevated and visually beautiful.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• Other information:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We value long-term creator relationships over one-time posts. Affiliates who consistently create strong content and drive engagement may be considered for:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Increased commission rates</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Paid collaborations</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">PR gifting opportunities</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Exclusive launch access</li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\">Ongoing ambassador partnerships</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We’re excited to grow with creators who genuinely love the brand and share our vision of effortless, elevated everyday style.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br></span></div></div></div></section><s